  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Jackulin @ Maria Jackulin vs The Designated Officer on 27 February, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.1 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 27.02.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P(MD)No.1278 of 2024 and W.M.P(MD)Nos.1310 & 1311 of 2024 Jackulin @ Maria Jackulin ... Petit Vs. 1.The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety Wing, Kanyakumari District. 2.The Food Safety Officer, Agasteeswaram Block, Kanyakumari District. ... Respo Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution praying this Court to issue a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to c the records on the file of the first respondent pertaining to its i proceedings in Na.Ka.No.2525/A2/2023 dated 20.12.2023 and to quash the same and consequently direct the respondent to de-seal the prem at Shop No.6, Fishing Harbour Road, Near Petrol Bulk, Chinnamuttom, Kanyakumari District so as to enable the petitioner to continuing h business. For Respondents : Mr.A.Kannan Additional Government Pleader ORDER Heard both sides.",
    "facts": "The petitioner is a small time shop keeper. The petitioner's shop premises were sealed on 20.12.2023. Seeking de-seal, the present writ petition came to be filed.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
